# Allowlist: only what the image build needs goes into the build context. Everything else,
# including .env.local (the YNAB token), data/ (real balances) and private/, stays out of every
# image layer.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!.python-version
!src/
!web/

# Local build output inside the allowed folders.
**/__pycache__
web/node_modules
web/dist
